     "html": "<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #000000;\">Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>You may have a lot of questions about how<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> <span style=\"color: #6ca439;\"><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-get-started\" style=\"color: #6ca439;\" rel=\"noopener\">private label supplements</a></span></span> fit into your business plans - thankfully the <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> team is here to help and get your answers.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>At <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>, we have years of experience helping eCommerce entrepreneurs, health care practitioners, and fitness brands determine bestselling formulas for their clientele.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We'll offer advice on how to successfully brand supplements according to your business model, and foundational tips to increase revenue from the beginning.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>A booming private label supplement business is just one click away!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #6ca439;\"><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #6ca439;\" rel=\"noopener\">Contact us today</a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span></span>for personalized recommendations on how to get started.</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
